Subject: [PATCH] feat: add OpenCode Go and submission confirmation

Owner-only alpha overlay for JobMatch AI upstream 977c90cb3100c8287a12085f8a1d52b8051c0977.
Keeps upstream UI/autofill unchanged. Adds one OpenAI-compatible OpenCode Go
provider and a standalone final-submission detector that reuses MARK_APPLIED.
---
 aiService.js                | 15 +++++++++++++++
 lib/submissionDetector.js   |  0
 manifest.json               |  3 ++-
 3 files changed

